  "question": {
    "text": "The line <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> cuts the ellipse <math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> at <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> . If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math> is the acute angle between normal at <math><mi>P</mi></math> and tangent at <math><mi>Q</mi></math>, then <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>34</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>34</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math>",
