  "solution": {
    "text": "Solving <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> , we get the intersection point <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />The equation of tangent at these points are <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> and <math><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Slope of tangents at <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> are <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> respectively<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Slope of normal at <math><mi>P</mi></math> is <math><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>34</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>"
